                <pb facs="0657" n="563" xml:id="pg563"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Manion to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Johannesburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-13"><hi rendition="#italic">January 13,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Cable re John Hays Hammond received. Orders being obeyed. Other Americans in
                    trouble. Please cable me direct instructions, so that I may act officially in
                    their behalf.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manion</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Consular Agent.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
